  "label": {
    "en": [
      "A sepia-toned postcard depicting a large, ornate building on a street corner. The architecture is grand, with arched windows and detailed stonework, suggesting a 19th-century European style. Several people are gathered near the building, and more are walking along the street. The scene is urban and historical, with a few trees and birds visible in the sky. At the bottom, printed text reads: 'Sundsvall, Postkontoret.'"
    ]
  },
